                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "49980d22-808d-3c86-b6a1-0a332ad6bbe4",
                        "entry_id": "b694b361-5edd-3925-83ab-4d879f57bded",
                        "glosses": [
                            "tequila"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b02d8550-921a-4198-86cf-c74ab22ab1b1",
                                "sense_id": "49980d22-808d-3c86-b6a1-0a332ad6bbe4",
                                "text": "Две знакомые. Одна раньше вообще не пила. Теперь как приду — сразу лимон режет, соль. А другая с мужем каждый вечер выпивает бутылку текилы. Каждый вечер!",
                                "translation": "(I know) two acquainted women. One of them has never drunk before at all. Now, every time I'm coming, she slices the lemon (and prepares) the salt. And the other one drinks a bottle of tequila every evening together with (her) husband. Every evening!",
                                "english": "(I know) two acquainted women. One of them has never drunk before at all. Now, every time I'm coming, she slices the lemon (and prepares) the salt. And the other one drinks a bottle of tequila every evening together with (her) husband. Every evening!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
